# EBM Workflows & Metrics

Training
- Golden Mean:
```bash
uv run --with torch python [notebook_experiments/ebt/train_golden_mean.py](mdc:notebook_experiments/ebt/train_golden_mean.py) \
  --preset golden_mean --device auto --context_window 64 --epochs 3 --steps_per_epoch 500 \
  --batch_size 64 --d_model 128 --layers 4 --heads 8 --dropout 0.1 --lr 3e-4
```
- Even Process:
```bash
uv run --with torch python [notebook_experiments/ebt/train_golden_mean.py](mdc:notebook_experiments/ebt/train_golden_mean.py) \
  --preset even_process --device auto --context_window 128 --epochs 3 --steps_per_epoch 500 \
  --batch_size 64 --d_model 128 --layers 4 --heads 8 --dropout 0.0 --lr 3e-4
```

Validation
- Golden Mean targets: H≈2/3 bits; p(0|0)≈0, p(0|1)≈0.5
- Even Process targets (p=0.5): p0|E≈0.5, p0|O≈0.0; frac_O≈1/3

Dataset Check (Even)
```bash
uv run python [notebook_experiments/ebt/check_even_dataset.py](mdc:notebook_experiments/ebt/check_even_dataset.py) \
  --data [notebook_experiments/even_process/even_process.dat](mdc:notebook_experiments/even_process/even_process.dat)
```

Cross-eval
```bash
uv run --with torch python [notebook_experiments/ebt/eval_ebm.py](mdc:notebook_experiments/ebt/eval_ebm.py) \
  --ckpt [notebook_experiments/even_process/ebm_ckpt.pt](mdc:notebook_experiments/even_process/ebm_ckpt.pt) \
  --data [notebook_experiments/golden_mean/data/golden_mean/golden_mean.dat](mdc:notebook_experiments/golden_mean/data/golden_mean/golden_mean.dat)
```

Tuning tips
- Increase context window (128–256) for Even Process.
- Use dropout=0.0 and weight_decay=0.0 for small binary tasks.
- Enable AMP/TF32 for GPU speedups.
